  "worked_solution": "The distance between $f(t)=8t-3$ and $g(t)=3t+2$ with respect to the given inner product is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}d & =\u2016f(t)-g(t)\u2016 \\\\  & =\u20168t-3-(3t+2)\u2016 \\\\  & =\u20165t-5\u2016 \\\\  & =\\sqrt{\u27e85t-5,5t-5\u27e9}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing the inner product, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\u27e85t-5,5t-5\u27e9 & =(5t-5){|}_{0}\\cdot (5t-5){|}_{0}+(5t-5){|}_{1}\\cdot (5t-5){|}_{1} \\\\  & =(-5)\\cdot (-5)+0\\cdot 0 \\\\  & =25.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the distance is $d=\\sqrt{25}=5.$",
